          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.101,
            0.125,
            0.391,
            0.182
          ],
          "content": "\\begin{aligned} &\\therefore \\left[ (2b)2 + \\left( \\frac{3\\sqrt{2}}{b} \\right)^2 \\right] + \\left[ (2b - b)2 + \\left( \\frac{6\\sqrt{2}}{b} - \\frac{3\\sqrt{2}}{b} \\right)^2 \\right] = b^2 + \\left( \\frac{6\\sqrt{2}}{b} \\right)^2,\\\\ \\end{aligned}",
          "image_source": "images/page_0_equation_0.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.104,
            0.187,
            0.141,
            0.206
          ],
          "content": "\\therefore b = \\sqrt{3} ,",
          "image_source": "images/page_0_equation_1.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.105,
            0.212,
            0.209,
            0.234
          ],
          "content": "\\therefore B(\\sqrt{3},2\\sqrt{6}),D(2\\sqrt{3},\\sqrt{6}),",
          "image_source": "images/page_0_equation_2.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.05,
            0.233,
            0.448,
            0.267
          ],
          "content": "直线OB的解析式为: $y = 2\\sqrt{2}x,$ ∴直线DF的解析式为: $y = 2\\sqrt{2}x - 3\\sqrt{6},$ 当y=0时， $2\\sqrt{2}x-3\\sqrt{6}=0,$"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.2,
            0.267,
            0.247,
            0.3
          ],
          "content": "\\therefore x = \\frac{3\\sqrt{3}}{2},",
          "image_source": "images/page_0_equation_4.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.202,
            0.303,
            0.263,
            0.343
          ],
          "content": "\\therefore F\\left(\\frac{3\\sqrt{3}}{2},0\\right),",
          "image_source": "images/page_0_equation_5.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.202,
            0.346,
            0.298,
            0.38
          ],
          "content": "\\because OE = \\sqrt{3},OF = \\frac{3\\sqrt{3}}{2},",
          "image_source": "images/page_0_equation_6.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.204,
            0.383,
            0.302,
            0.417
          ],
          "content": "\\therefore EF = OF - OE = \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2},",
          "image_source": "images/page_0_equation_7.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.205,
            0.422,
            0.25,
            0.454
          ],
          "content": "\\therefore \\frac{EF}{OE} = \\frac{1}{2},",
          "image_source": "images/page_0_equation_8.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.056,
            0.464,
            0.15,
            0.504
          ],
          "content": "故答案为: $\\frac{1}{2}, \\left( \\frac{3\\sqrt{3}}{2}, 0 \\right)$"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "bbox": [
